cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "HealICON: spectral and wave analysis of ICON output on the HEALPix grid"
abstract: >-
  HealICON is a command-line tool for wave and tidal analysis of global
  atmospheric simulations. It uses HEALPix as the base grid for
  interpolation, providing an equal-area environment for mapping tidal
  harmonics and gravity-wave spectra across the globe.
type: software
